"03:46.036" end="03:46.726">「kon</span><span begin="03:46.726" end="03:47.128">na</span><span begin="03:47.128" end="03:47.796">uta</span><span begin="03:47.796" end="03:48.235">at</span><span begin="03:48.235" end="03:48.658">ta</span><span begin="03:48.658" end="03:49.108">ne」t</span><span begin="03:49.108" end="03:49.536">te</span><span begin="03:49.536" end="03:49.756">de</span><span begin="03:49.756" end="03:50.181">a</span><span begin="03:50.181" end="03:50.637">i</span><span begin="03:50.637" end="03:51.516">o</span><span begin="03:51.516" end="03:52.408">kazoe</span><span begin="03:52.408" end="03:52.829">e</span><span begin="03:52.829" end="03:53.234">ra</span><span begin="03:53.234" end="03:53.441">re</span><span begin="03:53.441" end="03:53.686">ru</span><span begin="03:53.686" end="03:53.952">yo</span><span begin="03:53.952" end="03:54.137">u</span><span begin="03:54.137" end="03:57.544">ni</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">想象中的冒险 能否一字不漏的全部说出来吗</text><text for="L2">我想听你你告诉我 你见到了第几次的我？</text><text for="L3">为了与崭新的你相遇 我也做出了改变</text><text for="L4">好久不见了呢 如果能说出来 那会当场哭出来吧</text><text for="L5">无论喜欢 还是讨厌</text><text for="L6">都无数次讴歌着爱的你</text><text for="L7">令我无比眷恋 这不是说谎而是我的真心话</text><text for="L8">让我们再次相会吧</text><text for="L9">我们讨厌“2” 回到了“1”</text><text for="L10">走到现在我们犯过很多错</text><text for="L11">抹不掉的后悔与不会冷却的爱 让恋情重新启动</text><text for="L12">看吧 我们讨厌“1” 又回到了“2”</text><text for="L13">到了“3”以后把爱紧紧抓牢吧</text><text for="L14">想表达的情感 想传递的正确答案</text><text for="L15">只有一个 那就是“谢谢你”</text><text for="L16">想象的冒险 以后也会继续下去</text><text for="L17">乘着“3”和“9” 跨过语言的束缚</text><text for="L18">为了与崭新的你相遇 我也做出了改变</text><text for="L19">变得成熟稳重了 我觉得那很好了</text><text for="L20">无论喜欢 还是讨厌</text><text for="L21">都无数次讴歌着爱的你</text><text for="L22">令我无比眷恋 这不是说谎而是我的真心话</text><text for="L23">让我们再次相会吧 Ooh, yeah</text><text for="L24">坠入恋爱 笨蛋</text><text for="L25">深深爱上你 笨蛋</text><text for="L26">当个笨蛋就好 今后也要如此 笨蛋</text><text for="L27">我们讨厌“2” 又回到了“1”</text><text for="L28">走到现在我们犯过很多错</text><text for="L29">抹不掉的后悔与不会冷却的爱 让恋情重新启动</text><text for="L30">看吧 我们讨厌“1” 又回到了“2”</text><text for="L31">到了“3”以后把爱紧紧抓牢吧</text><text for="L32">想表达的情感 想传递的正确答案</text><text for="L33">只有一个 那就是“谢谢你”</text><text for="L34">Mayday就算知道是我 也不用再紧抱着我不放了</text><text for="L35">你不想拥抱没有终点的爱吗 更加细致的体会不安吧</text><text for="L36">妄想感伤代偿联盟 心怀着爱呼喊着理想</text><text for="L37">奏响有处可去的爱的旋律</text><text for="L38">至今为止非常感谢 希望还能与你感慨</text><text for="L39">「还能有这样的歌啊」还能细数这样的相遇</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:57.544"><div begin="00:21.942" end="03:57.544"><p begin="00:21.942" end="00:28.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:21.942" end="00:22.509">想</span><span begin="00:22.509" end="00:22.620">い</span><span begin="00:22.620" end="00:22.839">の</span><span begin="00:22.839" end="00:23.250">冒</span><span begin="00:23.250" end="00:23.730">険</span><span begin="00:23.730" end="00:24.279">を </span><span begin="00:25.251" end="00:25.652">忘</span><span begin="00:25.652" end="00:25.887">れ</span><span begin="00:25.887" end="00:26.070">ず</span><span begin="00:26.070" end="00:26.319">に</span><span begin="00:26.319" end="00:26.775">全</span><span begin="00:26.775" end="00:26.971">部</span><span begin="00:26.971" end="00:27.148">言</span><span begin="00:27.148" end="00:27.594">え</span><span begin="00:27.594" end="00:27.807">る</span><span begin="00:27.807" end="00:28.014">か</span><span begin="00:28.014" end="00:28.560">な</span></p><p begin="00:28.947" end="00:35.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:28.947" end="00:29.331">君</span><span begin="00:29.331" end="00:29.524">か</span><span begin="00:29.524" end="00:29.772">ら</span><span begin="00:29.772" end="00:29.989">聞</span><span begin="00:29.989" end="00:30.208">き</span><span begin="00:30.208" end="00:30.600">た</span><span begin="00:30.600" end="00:30.696">い</span><span begin="00:30.696" end="00:31.224">よ </span><span begin="00:32.2